---
description: Playwright QA authoring conventions
globs:
  - "**/*.spec.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Before writing or changing Playwright tests, read:

- `core/ai/qa-principles.md`
- `core/ai/test-authoring-workflow.md`

Write tests against observable browser behavior. Prefer stable user-facing locators, clear setup, and targeted assertions.

Do not weaken assertions, skip tests, delete tests, or update baselines without explicit human approval.

Run the smallest relevant Playwright command before broad suites.
